</div>
<p class="conditions">
	All examples keep the same silhouette, size and mounting. B and C use Fighter
	facet colours and Light ion charcoal tones. C assigns the outer slopes and
	inward-facing walls opposite responses to one upper-left light; its yellow
	supports share that direction. This is a flat-vector lighting proposal, not a
	change to game lighting.
</p>
